stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OutboxQueued: Hotel reply / event committed with audit
  OutboxQueued --> PolicyBlocked: Consent, window, template, policy or spend guard denies
  OutboxQueued --> Sending: Worker leases and validates request
  Sending --> ProviderAccepted: Meta returns wamid / accepted
  Sending --> RetryPending: Network 429/5xx or temporary timeout
  RetryPending --> Sending: Capped backoff with dedupe and idempotency
  RetryPending --> Unknown: Max attempts or provider outcome uncertain
  ProviderAccepted --> Sent: Meta status webhook says sent
  ProviderAccepted --> Delivered: Meta status says delivered (sent may be skipped)
  Sent --> Delivered: Delivery callback
  Delivered --> Read: Read callback if user permits
  ProviderAccepted --> Failed: Failed webhook / rejected message
  Sent --> Failed: Failure status
  PolicyBlocked --> HumanRequired: Cannot legally or safely send
  Failed --> HumanRequired: Contact/transport exception
  Unknown --> HumanRequired: Reconcile before reattempt
  Read --> [*]
  HumanRequired --> [*]
  note right of ProviderAccepted
    API acceptance is NOT device delivery.
    Preserve all raw signed status events for reconciliation.
  end note
  note right of PolicyBlocked
    Outside 24h: only approved template.
    Separate consent/marketing and cost guards.
  end note
